{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05247","headline":"幸梨园观打球应制 · 武平一","name":"幸梨园观打球应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节重遨游，分镳应彩球。\n骖驔廻上苑，蹀躞绕通沟。\n影就红尘没，光随赭汗流。\n赏阑清景暮，歌舞乐时休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武平一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}